Package: c3g.shiny.authz
Title: Authentication and Authorization Helpers for C3G Shiny Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Paul", "Stretenowich", email = "paul.stretenowich@mcgill.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers for C3G Shiny apps running behind oauth2-proxy: reading the
    forwarded-groups header for cosmetic Tier 2 UI (c3g_groups()), and calling a per-app
    OPA sidecar for real per-action Tier 3 authorization (c3g_require_authz()). See the
    web-app-template repo's for-app-developers.md for where this fits among the
    authentication/authorization tiers used across C3G web apps.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    httr2,
    shiny
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/c3g/c3g.shiny.authz
BugReports: https://github.com/c3g/c3g.shiny.authz/issues
